# A scraper's own output is large, machine-specific and stale by the time
# anyone reads it. The two committed samples are the exception.
*.json
*.csv
!sample_output.json
!sample_output.csv
flippa_listings.*
*.meta.json
*_debug.html
*_debug.png
live_results/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.fingerprint_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
*.log
.env
*.key
secrets*

# Local-only working directories, announced here rather than hidden in
# .git/info/exclude — that file is not cloned, so every fresh checkout used to
# start with no rule against committing these.
#   captures/  multi-megabyte page dumps the fixtures were cut from
#   legacy/    the superseded first version of this scraper, kept for reference
captures/
legacy/
